    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Your egg became frigid cold to the touch as it was imbued by an ivory drachiri, and you bear white or metallic scales that are well suited for the cold, with firm ridges, coats of fur, and elegant horns. </span>You gain a second trait from your Ivory Drachiri benefactor. <span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You ignore difficult terrain on the ground and in flight from wind and snow and treat greater difficult terrain in these conditions as difficult terrain, and treat environmental cold as one step less severe.</span></p>"
